// phehcpdisplay.mmp -- OURS: the Display applet of the Hildon control panel (a minimal stand-in, docs hildon-port.md 7.104). Code = prebuilt archive libphehcpdisplay.a (recipes/build_hcp_x32.sh) + the Symbian calls (phehcpdisplay_sym.cpp);
// its exports (execute / save_state) are looked up by name through resource/gmodule/phehcpdisplay.sym (GModule, glib-symbian).
TARGET			phehcpdisplay.dll
TARGETTYPE		dll
UID				0x1000008d 0xE7016C05
CAPABILITY		all -tcb
VENDORID		0
EPOCALLOWDLLDATA
OS_LAYER_SYSTEMINCLUDE_SYMBIAN
OS_LAYER_LIBC_SYSTEMINCLUDE
SOURCEPATH		.
SOURCE			phehcpdisplay_sym.cpp
LIBRARY			euser.lib libc.lib libm.lib libpthread.lib pheglib.lib phegobject.lib phegmodule.lib phegthread.lib phepango.lib phecairo.lib phegdk.lib phegtk.lib phehildon.lib centralrepository.lib
SMPSAFE
